### 🧑‍🔬 About Me

I'm a Robotics Engineering student who loves building things that move, think, and (hopefully) don't break on the first run.

I spend most of my time somewhere between CAD models and microcontroller datasheets. Whether it's designing a mechanism in SolidWorks or debugging serial communication at 2 AM — I genuinely enjoy the entire process of bringing a robot from idea to reality.

- 🤖 Currently deep into **robotics & embedded systems**
- 🧠 Exploring **AI and Computer Vision**
- 🔩 I design, build, and program — the full stack of hardware
- ☕ Fueled by curiosity (and way too much chai)

---

